# XTC AI – MTG Card Assistant

A web application that retrieves Magic:
The Gathering card information and uses
AI to summarize card rulings.

## Features
- Search for MTG cards
- Display card artwork
- Retrieve official rulings
- Generate AI summaries

## Technologies
- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript
- Hugging Face Inference API
- [Card data API]

## Screenshots
[Application screenshots]

## Installation
[Setup instructions]

## Architecture
- Type the name of the card in the search bar and tap "Search."
- When the card art and text are returned, tap "Explain the Card."
- A popup with a plain English explanation of the card will appear.

## Future Improvements
- Error handling
- Improved search
- Mobile responsiveness
